<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n20761" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βράγχος</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>hoarseness</i> or <i>sore throat
				causing hoarseness</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>VM</u>
				19
			</span></i> (pl.), al., <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				2.49
			</span></i>: pl., <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				860a30
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				37
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> a
			<i>disease</i> in swine (either <i>anthrax</i> or
				<i>foot-and-mouth disease</i>), <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>HA</u>
				603a31
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βράγχος, τό</span>, in pl., 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βράγχια</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>H.</u>
				1.160
			</span></i>; but <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βράγχος, ὁ</span>, in <i><span class="en">
				Ptol.
				<u>Alm.</u>
				8.1
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
